<figure id="S3.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S3.T2.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S3.T2.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The performance comparison on the NuInstruct dataset <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib14" title="" class="ltx_ref">6</a>]</cite> is conducted against existing SOTA methods. This experiment is crucial for evaluating the performance gains of VGGDrive in cross-view <span id="S3.T2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">risk object perception</span> (<span id="S3.T2.8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MAP</span>), <span id="S3.T2.8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">state predictio</span>n, and <span id="S3.T2.8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">ego-motion forecasting</span> within autonomous driving scenarios. The symbol * indicates <math id="S3.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\max\left(\frac{\text{Accuracy}+\text{MAP}+\text{BLEU}-\text{MAE}}{4},0\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mtext>Accuracy</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>MAP</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>BLEU</mtext></mrow><mo>−</mo><mtext>MAE</mtext></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\max\left(\frac{\text{Accuracy}+\text{MAP}+\text{BLEU}-\text{MAE}}{4},0\right).</annotation></semantics></math></span></figcaption>
<div id="S3.T2.9" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:938.4pt;height:73.9pt;vertical-align:-34.8pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-76.4pt,6.0pt) scale(0.9,0.9) ;">
<table id="S3.T2.9.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S3.T2.9.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T2.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:-0.1pt 1.2pt;" rowspan="2"><span id="S3.T2.9.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">Dataset</span></td>
<td id="S3.T2.9.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:-0.1pt 1.2pt;" rowspan="2"><span id="S3.T2.9.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text">Metrics</span></td>
<td id="S3.T2.9.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:-0.1pt 1.2pt;" colspan="4">Zero-shot Models</td>
