<figure id="S3.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S3.T3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="S3.T3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The performance comparison on the DriveLM dataset <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib12" title="" class="ltx_ref">38</a>]</cite> is conducted against existing SOTA methods. This experiment is crucial for evaluating the performance gains of VGGDrive in cross-view risk object perception (<span id="S3.T3.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Match</span>), action prediction and planning.</span></figcaption>
